      "message": "I think the caller should be informed that the plugin failed being started/reloaded/disabled.\n\n```\nssh -p 29418 admin@localhost gerrit plugin rm healthcheck\n```\n\nshould output a useful result message:\n\n```\nfatal: Plugin healthcheck has registered an ApiModule therefore its restart/reload is not allowed\n```\n\nThis behaviour would be consistent with other types of failures (i.e. `plugin not running`, `remote installation is disabled`, `unsupported plugin type` and so on).\n\nHave you considered raising a `PluginInstallException` rather than just logging?",
